epos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/611","id":375751253,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDM3NTc1MTI1Mw==","user":{"login":"wking","id":209920,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwOTkyMA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/209920?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wking","html_url":"https://github.com/wking","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wking/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wking/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wking/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wking/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wking/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wking/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wking/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wking/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wking/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2018-03-23T17:58:25Z","updated_at":"2018-03-23T17:58:25Z","body":"> Short Identifier: Please choose for me.\r\n\r\nMaybe `Frola-OWDL-1.0` (acronyming most of the [upstream title][1]).\r\n\r\n> OSI-approved: don't know\r\n\r\n[Google is not aware of any OSI discussion][2], and the license isn't listed [here][3], so I'm pretty sure this is not OSI approved.\r\n\r\n[1]: https://github.com/froala/design-blocks/blob/1.0.2/LICENSE#L5\r\n[2]: https://www.google.com/search?q=frola+site%3Alists.opensource.org\r\n[3]: https://opensource.org/licenses/alphabetical","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/375751253/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/382802840","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/611#issuecomment-382802840","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/611","id":382802840,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDM4MjgwMjg0MA==","user":{"login":"bradleeedmondson","id":7350638,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczNTA2Mzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7350638?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradleeedmondson","html_url":"https://github.com/bradleeedmondson","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradleeedmondson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradleeedmondson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradleeedmondson/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradleeedmondson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradleeedmondson/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradleeedmondson/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradleeedmondson/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradleeedmondson/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradleeedmondson/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2018-04-19T16:42:04Z","updated_at":"2018-04-19T16:42:04Z","body":"Discussed on legal call today, but did not reach consensus. Need to discuss again on next legal call.\r\n\r\nThis is arguably not a FOSS license, since it prohibits unbundled commercial distribution.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/382802840/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/435044902","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/611#issuecomment-435044902","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/611","id":435044902,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDQzNTA0NDkwMg==","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2018-11-01T13:43:44Z","updated_at":"2018-11-01T13:43:44Z","body":"This is based on [OFL-1.1](https://spdx.org/licenses/OFL-1.1.html). OFL-1.1 has been considered [open by OSI](https://opensource.org/licenses/OFL-1.1) and [free by FSF](https://www.gnu.org/licenses/license-list.en.html#SILOFL).\r\n\r\nNotably, though, OFL-1.1's restriction is just that it cannot be sold by itself. The FSF guidance linked above says that \"Since a simple Hello World program will satisfy the requirement, it is harmless.\"\r\n\r\nBy contrast, the Froala license in 3(a) adds restrictions on what it can be used for: `Neither the Work nor any of its individual components, in Original or Modified Versions, may be . . . (ii) used for website or app generators; (iii) used to create templates, themes, and plugins for sale.`\r\n\r\nBased on that, I'm inclined to say that this does not really meet the current [SPDX license inclusion principles](https://spdx.org/spdx-license-list/license-list-overview). I'm of course open to others' thoughts!","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/435044902/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/435069915","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/611#issuecomment-435069915","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/611","id":435069915,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDQzNTA2OTkxNQ==","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2018-11-01T15:05:06Z","updated_at":"2018-11-01T15:05:06Z","body":"I'd agree @swinslow  - clearly restricts specific uses, which makes it not open source.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/435069915/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh